      "text": "need. Whether you're a seasoned manager with institutional history, a technician with troubleshooting tricks learned over decades, or a founder with lessons from a hundred decisions—the problem is the same: **your knowledge is trapped in your head, and it scales poorly",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "You could write documentation, but documentation is static",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
